00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:37.440
First up is a big step forward for self-driving delivery vehicles. The company Nuro just received approval to test fully driverless cars on real California roads in partnership with Uber.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:46.680
These vehicles will handle navigation, safety decisions, and passenger pickup using AI with no one sitting in the driver's seat at all.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:57.320
Think of it like a smashed character from a racing video game stepping out of the screen and driving on actual city streets while following every traffic rule.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:03.680
You cannot ride one yet, but you can watch how the technology already handles real world movement.

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:12.740
Search YouTube for Nuro Autonomous Vehicle Test Videos and pay attention to how the cars manage intersections and pedestrians.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:19.120
Then imagine requesting a ride and watching a vehicle arrive with no driver inside.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:25.720
Next is something that could let almost anyone start a food business without owning a kitchen.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:37.340
Entrepreneur Mark Lore is building a system that combines robotic kitchens with AI so you can launch a virtual restaurant brand just by describing your idea in plain words.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:49.860
You might type something like a late night spot serving only breakfast tacos with Korean flavors, and the AI would help create the menu, branding, and even coordinate the robotic preparation.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:59.340
It turns what used to be an expensive complicated business into something closer to posting a creative idea online and watching it take shape.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:04.680
While the full platform is not open yet, you can practice the prompting part right now.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:17.500
Open Chat GPT, describe a restaurant concept in detail, and ask it to generate a sample menu, a logo description, and a sample social media post for your imaginary spot.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:26.740
That exercise shows you how AI can turn a rough idea into concrete next steps without any coding or restaurant experience.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:40.580
